Package: prestr
Title: Generate PowerPoint Presentations from Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ujjwal", "Acharya", , "acharyau@lawrence.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to turn data frames into presentation-ready
    PowerPoint slides, auto-generated charts, and summary statistics.
    Functions wrap the officer, flextable, and ggplot2 packages with
    input validation and sensible defaults.
